# Предложения
## Получить список предложений
GET http://localhost:4000/offers HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

###

## Добавить новое предложение
POST http://localhost:4000/offers HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Cozy room near park",
  "description": "Spacious modern apartment located in the historical city center with great transport access.",
  "city": "Paris",
  "previewImage": "preview.jpg",
  "housingImages": [
    "picture-1.jpg",
    "picture-2.jpg",
    "picture-3.jpg",
    "picture-4.jpg",
    "picture-5.jpg",
    "picture-6.jpg"
  ],
  "isPremium": false,
  "isFavorite": false,
  "housingType": "apartment",
  "roomsCount": 1,
  "guestsCount": 2,
  "price": 52000,
  "amenities": [
    "Breakfast",
    "Laptop friendly workspace",
    "Washer"
  ],
  "userId": "22baa78682093da034c576d2",
  "location": {
    "latitude": 40.3235,
    "longitude": 60.3582
  }
}

###

## Получить предложение по id
GET http://localhost:4000/offers/69f21f4f34a9137cb4162f59 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

###

## Обновить предложение по id
PATCH http://localhost:4000/offers/69f21f4f34a9137cb4162f59 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Modern apartment in city center",
  "isPremium": true
}

###

## Удалить предложение по id
DELETE http://localhost:4000/offers/69f21f4f34a9137cb4162f59 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

###

## Получить список премиальных предложений для города
GET http://localhost:4000/offers/premium/Paris HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

###

## Получить список избранных предложений
GET http://localhost:4000/offers/favorite HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

###

## Добавить предложение в список избранных
POST http://localhost:4000/offers/22baa78682093da034c576d2/favorite HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

###

## Удалить предложение из списка избранных
DELETE http://localhost:4000/offers/22baa78682093da034c576d2/favorite HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

###
